{"id":"lesson-1731","topicId":1731,"title":"4 窦娥冤(节选)","sourceTitle":"4 窦娥冤（节选）","blockId":"bixiu-xia","blockTitle":"必修下","forumUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/t/topic/1731","createdAt":"2024-08-22T00:46:41Z","updatedAt":"2024-08-22T06:06:35Z","postCount":1,"excerpt":"窦娥冤[1]（节选） 关汉卿 第三折 （外[2]扮监斩官上，云）下官监斩官是也。今日处决犯人，着[3]做公的[4]把住巷口，休放往来人闲走。（净[5]扮公人，鼓三通、锣三下科[6]。刽子磨旗[7]、提刀，押正旦[8]带枷上。刽子云）行动些[9]，行动些，监斩官去法场上多时了。（正旦唱） 【正宫[10]】【端正好[11]】没来由犯王法，不提防遭刑宪[12]，叫声屈动地惊天。顷刻间游魂先赴森罗殿，怎不将天地也生埋怨[13]。 【滚绣球】有日月朝暮悬，有鬼神掌着生死权。天地也！只合把清浊分辨，可怎生糊突了盗跖、颜渊[14]？为善的受贫穷更命短，造恶的享富贵又寿延。天地也！做得个怕硬欺软，却原来也这般顺水推船！地也，你不分好歹何为地？天也，你错勘[15]贤愚枉做天！哎，只落得两泪涟涟。 （刽子云）快行动些，误了时辰也。（正旦唱） 【倘秀才】则被这枷纽[16]的我左侧右偏，人拥的我前合后偃[17]。我窦娥向哥哥行[18]有句言。（刽子云）","textbook":{"bookId":"高中_语文_普通高中教科书_语文必修_下册","bookTitle":"普通高中教科书·语文必修 下册（人教版）","imageBase":"https://img.rdfzer.com/pages/9535dacc9628","tocLabel":"4窦娥冤（节选）/关汉卿","tocScore":1.0,"startPage":28,"pages":[28,29,30,31],"pageImages":[{"page":28,"src":"https://img.rdfzer.com/pages/9535dacc9628/p28.webp","label":"p28"},{"page":29,"src":"https://img.rdfzer.com/pages/9535dacc9628/p29.webp","label":"p29"},{"page":30,"src":"https://img.rdfzer.com/pages/9535dacc9628/p30.webp","label":"p30"},{"page":31,"src":"https://img.rdfzer.com/pages/9535dacc9628/p31.webp","label":"p31"}]},"forumImages":[],"resources":[{"href":"#footnote-11178-1","text":"[1]","kind":"link","postNumber":1},{"href":"#footnote-11178-2","text":"[2]","kind":"link","postNumber":1},{"href":"#footnote-11178-3","text":"[3]","kind":"link","postNumber":1},{"href":"#footnote-11178-4","text":"[4]","kind":"link","postNumber":1},{"href":"#footnote-11178-5","text":"[5]","kind":"link","postNumber":1},{"href":"#footnote-11178-6","text":"[6]","kind":"link","postNumber":1},{"href":"#footnote-11178-7","text":"[7]","kind":"link","postNumber":1},{"href":"#footnote-11178-8","text":"[8]","kind":"link","postNumber":1},{"href":"#footnote-11178-9","text":"[9]","kind":"link","postNumber":1},{"href":"#footnote-11178-10","text":"[10]","kind":"link","postNumber":1},{"href":"#footnote-11178-11","text":"[11]","kind":"link","postNumber":1},{"href":"#footnote-11178-12","text":"[12]","kind":"link","postNumber":1},{"href":"#footnote-11178-13","text":"[13]","kind":"link","postNumber":1},{"href":"#footnote-11178-14","text":"[14]","kind":"link","postNumber":1},{"href":"#footnote-11178-15","text":"[15]","kind":"link","postNumber":1},{"href":"#footnote-11178-16","text":"[16]","kind":"link","postNumber":1},{"href":"#footnote-11178-17","text":"[17]","kind":"link","postNumber":1},{"href":"#footnote-11178-18","text":"[18]","kind":"link","postNumber":1},{"href":"#footnote-11178-19","text":"[19]","kind":"link","postNumber":1},{"href":"#footnote-11178-20","text":"[20]","kind":"link","postNumber":1},{"href":"#footnote-11178-21","text":"[21]","kind":"link","postNumber":1},{"href":"#footnote-11178-22","text":"[22]","kind":"link","postNumber":1},{"href":"#footnote-11178-23","text":"[23]","kind":"link","postNumber":1},{"href":"#footnote-11178-24","text":"[24]","kind":"link","postNumber":1},{"href":"#footnote-11178-25","text":"[25]","kind":"link","postNumber":1},{"href":"#footnote-11178-26","text":"[26]","kind":"link","postNumber":1},{"href":"#footnote-11178-27","text":"[27]","kind":"link","postNumber":1},{"href":"#footnote-11178-28","text":"[28]","kind":"link","postNumber":1},{"href":"#footnote-11178-29","text":"[29]","kind":"link","postNumber":1},{"href":"#footnote-11178-30","text":"[30]","kind":"link","postNumber":1},{"href":"#footnote-11178-31","text":"[31]","kind":"link","postNumber":1},{"href":"#footnote-11178-32","text":"[32]","kind":"link","postNumber":1},{"href":"#footnote-11178-33","text":"[33]","kind":"link","postNumber":1},{"href":"#footnote-11178-34","text":"[34]","kind":"link","postNumber":1},{"href":"#footnote-11178-35","text":"[35]","kind":"link","postNumber":1},{"href":"#footnote-11178-36","text":"[36]","kind":"link","postNumber":1},{"href":"#footnote-11178-37","text":"[37]","kind":"link","postNumber":1},{"href":"#footnote-11178-38